    "hitCooldown": 0.45,
    "messageSeconds": 4,
    "bounce": 420,
    "ramSpeedRatio": 0.6,
    "_ram": "A ram counts when the speed aimed at the wall is above ramSpeedRatio x your cruising speed (or you dash). The wall bounces you back (bounce), so holding forward keeps ramming it.",
