  "checkpointCrab": {
    "_comment": "A Checkpoint Crab appears every `everyLevels` levels. Defeat it and that level is saved: after dying you swim again from it (instead of from level 1). Its strength is set from yours when it appears, so the fight is fair for every hero and perk: it takes about `hitsToDefeat` of your bites, and each pinch takes `pinchHpFraction` of your health and stuns you briefly. It stays around its spot (`homeWidth` x `homeHeight`) near the deepest water you may swim in, and chases you only within `guardRange`.",
